      <profiles>
        <profile name="Destabilising Quakes" id="9e7c-b3bd-efea-acc0" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit that was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit by tremor shells during its just-finished shooting sequence: that unit must take a Battle-shock test, applying -1 to that test.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Geomantic Hunters" id="f38e-73dc-2b09-3da7" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit is selected to shoot, you may use this ability, twice per battle per unit, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, while making attacks made with breacher ordnance, until the end of the phase, you can re-roll the Wound roll.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
