      <profiles>
        <profile name="Kapricus Carrier" id="bf51-055e-8aa7-6f33" hidden="false" typeId="c547-1836-d8a-ff4f" typeName="Unit">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="M" typeId="e703-ecb6-5ce7-aec1">12"</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="T" typeId="d29d-cf75-fc2d-34a4">7</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Sv" typeId="450-a17e-9d5e-29da">4+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="W" typeId="750a-a2ec-90d3-21fe">7</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="LD" typeId="58d2-b879-49c7-43bc">7+</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="OC" typeId="bef7-942a-1a23-59f8">2</characteristic>
            <characteristic name="InSv" typeId="55a7-5b54-c60d-11dc"></characteristic>
            <characteristic name="Base" typeId="nr-base-size">70x105mm</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="eeef-a499-e9ca-853d" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Firing Deck" id="5d75-df09-7e24-658a" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Firing Deck X ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Scanner Uplinks" id="9b47-cf53-b38b-2a06" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the start of your next turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit if the selected unit does not have the MONSTER keyword and the selected unit does not have the VEHICLE keyword and the unit was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit during its just-finished shooting sequence:
    -&gt; That unit is marked as suppressed.
    -&gt; While the unit is tagged suppressed, that unit gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Scouts" id="523a-05eb-d82e-9905" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit gains the Scouts X" ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
