        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="a59c-c0e9-8a87-87d8" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="MultiCOG Targeting" id="05be-82a0-bba6-7e38" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">You can: While making ranged attacks:
  -&gt; This model ignores any modifiers to its Ballistic Skill characteristics.
  -&gt; This model ignores any modifiers to its Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Damaged" id="2b9f-3712-33e5-d259" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While the model has X or fewer wounds remaining, X being its rating, this model gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Prioritised Efficiency" id="1130-c5e0-3bde-f684" hidden="false" targetId="e8a2-a9a7-0c99-e17f" type="rule"/>
