          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Each time an enemy unit ends a move, during the Movement phase, in the opponent's turn, while the triggering unit is within 8" of the unit, while the unit is unengaged, the unit can make a Normal move of up to D6".</characteristic>
