        <profile name="Resource Transmutation" id="f101-95c5-5b3c-f69c" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">Once per turn, during the Shooting phase, until the end of the phase, the unit's weapons gain [SUSTAINED HITS 1].</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Science Guild Support" id="06f0-133d-91f0-58d6" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">While this model is within 3" of a friendly INFANTRY LEAGUES OF VOTANN unit without the Lone Operative ability other than this unit, this model gains the Lone Operative ability.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Deadly Demise" id="d1ff-3272-8f93-8d21" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When this model is destroyed, after the units embarked within it have made their emergency disembark moves:
  -&gt; Roll one D6: on a 6+, for each unit: while the unit is within 6" of this model, the unit suffers a number of mortal wounds equal to its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
