      <profiles>
        <profile name="Cyberstimms" id="96ab-553d-56b2-36fc" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When a model in the unit is destroyed:
  -&gt; Unless the triggering unit has fought this phase, while the Fortify Takeover ability of Prioritised Efficiency is active, roll one D6+1. On a 4+, leave that model on the battlefield; after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, it can fight. Remove it after it has fought.
  -&gt; Unless the triggering unit has fought this phase, unless the Fortify Takeover ability of Prioritised Efficiency is active, roll one D6. On a 4+, leave that model on the battlefield; after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, it can fight. Remove it after it has fought.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Subterranean Explosives" id="c985-f42f-0aef-4341" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the start of your next Shooting phase:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit if the selected unit does not have the MONSTER keyword and the selected unit does not have the VEHICLE keyword and the unit was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit by mole grenade launcher during its just-finished shooting sequence: that unit cannot be targeted with the Fire Overwatch Stratagem.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Feel No Pain" id="b44f-e704-8585-38e7" hidden="false" typeId="9cc3-6d83-4dd3-9b64" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">The unit has the Feel No Pain X+ ability, X being its rating.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <infoLinks>
        <infoLink name="Prioritised Efficiency" id="d7f6-aa00-a722-5d9d" hidden="false" targetId="e8a2-a9a7-0c99-e17f" type="rule"/>
