              </constraints>
              <rules>
                <rule name="Assailed From Every Angle" id="4227-09e3-177d-c69c" hidden="false">
                  <description>When the unit is selected to shoot during the Shooting phase, until the end of the battle round:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit (excluding MONSTER or VEHICLE units): this unit must target that unit with ranged attacks.
  If the target was hit by an attack this phase:
    While the target is tagged assailed:
      -&gt; Subtract 2 from the target's Move characteristic.
      -&gt; The target gets -2 to Charge rolls.
    -&gt; The target gains the assailed keyword.</description>
                </rule>
              </rules>
              <categoryLinks>
