                  <description>All friendly LEAGUES OF VOTANN units lose the Hostile Acquisition (Prioritised Efficiency) ability and cannot gain it except from this ability.
All friendly LEAGUES OF VOTANN units lose the Fortify Takeover (Prioritised Efficiency) ability and cannot gain it except from this ability.
-&gt; At the start of the battle: all friendly LEAGUES OF VOTANN units gain the Hostile Acquisition (Prioritised Efficiency) ability.
-&gt; At the end of your Command phase, you may use this ability: while you have 3+ yp pool, spend 3 YP; if all friendly LEAGUES OF VOTANN units have exactly one of the Hostile Acquisition (Prioritised Efficiency) and Fortify Takeover (Prioritised Efficiency) abilities, all friendly LEAGUES OF VOTANN units simultaneously lose that ability and gain the other.</description>
