              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">After the unit resolves its attacks, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, until the start of your next turn:
  -&gt; Select one enemy unit if the selected unit does not have the TITANIC keyword and the unit was hit by an attack made by the triggering unit during its just-finished shooting sequence:
    -&gt; That unit is marked as suppressed.
    -&gt; While the unit is tagged suppressed, that unit gets -1 to Hit rolls.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <costs>
