                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When a model in the unit is destroyed, while making melee attacks, unless that unit has fought this phase, roll one D6. On a 4+, leave that model on the battlefield; after the attacking unit has finished making its attacks, it can fight. Remove it after it has fought.</characteristic>
