                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="9b8f-694b-e5e-b573">When the unit is selected to shoot, during the Shooting phase, in your turn, if the triggering unit disembarked from a Transport this turn or while the unit is tagged trivarg yp spent, until the end of the phase:
  -&gt; You can: while the unit is not tagged trivarg yp spent, unless the triggering unit disembarked from a Transport this turn, spend 2 YP; the unit is marked as trivarg yp spent until the end of the phase.
  -&gt; Ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [SUSTAINED HITS 2].</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="51b2-306e-1021-d207" value="40"/>
            <cost name="Enhancements" typeId="f759-1bc4-cb3a-f0d2" value="1"/>
