  <sharedRules>
    <rule name="Prioritised Efficiency" id="e8a2-a9a7-0c99-e17f" hidden="false">
      <description>If your Army Faction is LEAGUES OF VOTANN, for the rest of the battle:
  -&gt; At the start of the battle:
    -&gt; Until the start of your next Command phase: all friendly LEAGUES OF VOTANN units gain the Hostile Acquisition ability (while the target is within range of an objective marker, the unit gets +1 to Hit rolls; you can re-roll the Charge roll; you can re-roll the Advance roll).
  -&gt; At the end of each phase:
    During the Command phase:
      -&gt; If you control 1+ home objectives in your territory, you gain 1 YP.
      From the second battle round onward:
        -&gt; If you control 1+ objectives (excluding home), you gain 1 YP.
        -&gt; If you control 2+ objectives (excluding home), you gain 1 YP.
        -&gt; If you hold more objectives than the opponent, you gain 1 YP.
    During the Command phase, in your turn:
      -&gt; While you have at most 6 yp pool, until the start of your next Command phase: all friendly LEAGUES OF VOTANN units gain the Hostile Acquisition (Prioritised Efficiency) ability.
    During the Command phase, in your turn:
      -&gt; While you have 7+ yp pool, until the start of your next Command phase: all friendly LEAGUES OF VOTANN units gain the Fortify Takeover ability (while the unit is within range of an objective marker you control, the unit gets +1 to Hit rolls; when the attack's S is more than the target's T, unless the unit has the VEHICLE keyword, the attacking unit gets -1 to Wound rolls).</description>
    </rule>
  </sharedRules>
